4
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:21,250
They said eight slots,plus removable id.

5
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:24,220
To any rational person,that would mean room for nine cards,

6
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:27,590
but they don't tell you,the removable id takes up one slot.

7
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,140
It's a nightmare!

8
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:32,000
Okay,now,do you really need

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,730
the honorary justice league of america membership card?

10
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:38,750
It's been in every wallet I've owned since I was five.

11
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,700
Why?

12
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:42,960
It says "keep this on your person at all times."

13
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,840
it's right here under batman's signature.

14
00:00:52,450 --> 00:00:55,260
Guess whose parents just got broadband.

15
00:00:55,270 --> 00:00:57,480
Leonard,may I present,live from new delhi,

16
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,170
Dr.And mrs.V.M.Koothrappali.

17
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:00,330
Hi!

18
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:03,340
Tilt up the camera up! I'm looking at his crotch.

19
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:04,360
Sorry,papa.

20
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,610
Oh,that's much better.

21
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:07,010
- Hi. - Hi!

22
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:09,630
And over here is sheldon.

23
00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:10,770
Hi!

24
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:12,150
He lives with leonard.

25
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,620
Oh,that's nice.

26
00:01:13,630 --> 00:01:15,400
Like haroon and tanvir.

27
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:17,000
No,no. Not like haroon and tanvir.

28
00:01:17,010 --> 00:01:18,570
Such sweet young men.

29
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:22,060
They just adopted the cutest little punjabi baby.

30
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:24,500
No,we're not like haroon and tanvir.

31
00:01:25,470 --> 00:01:27,610
So,are you boys academics like our son?

32
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:28,420
Yes.

33
00:01:28,430 --> 00:01:31,430
And your parents are comfortable with your limited earning potential?

34
