66
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:44,720
Why are you telling me about my own culture?

67
00:02:45,490 --> 00:02:47,400
You seemed confused.

68
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:50,280
Sorry,mumi,papa,but with all due respect,

69
00:02:50,290 --> 00:02:51,640
- I really don't want to... - I'm sorry,darling.

70
00:02:51,650 --> 00:02:52,740
