77
00:03:09,530 --> 00:03:13,060
Actually,I read somewhere that it's one of the most popular programs in india.

78
00:03:13,070 --> 00:03:15,690
It might speak to a cultural aspiration

79
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:17,390
to have one's children enter the medical profession.

80
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:18,650
I bet you're right.

81
00:03:18,660 --> 00:03:20,020
I bet they love scrubs.

82
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:21,250
What's not to love?

83
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:22,950
Excuse me! Hello?

84
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:25,080
My parents are trying to marry me off to a total stranger.

85
00:03:25,090 --> 00:03:26,930
What am I going to do?

86
00:03:26,940 --> 00:03:28,620
I suggest you go through with it.

87
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:29,690
What?

88
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:32,040
Romantic love as the basis for marriage

89
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:34,190
has only existed since the 19th century.

90
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:36,280
Up until then,arranged marriages were the norm,

91
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,370
and it served society quite well.

92
00:03:38,380 --> 00:03:40,140
It's the entire premise of fiddler on the roof.

93
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:43,350
I'm not a big fan of musicals,but I love that show.

94
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,260
Me too.

95
00:03:44,270 --> 00:03:46,010
Of course,it speaks to me culturally.

96
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:50,590
Understandable,but there's a universality to that story which transcends ethnicity.

97
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:52,560
Let's not forget it's got some really catchy tunes.

98
00:03:52,570 --> 00:03:53,850
- oh,absolutely. - Yeah!

99
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,930
Okay,I know what I'm going to do.

100
00:03:55,940 --> 00:03:56,640
What?

101
