125
00:05:46,060 --> 00:05:47,220
- Give me the phone. - Why?

126
00:05:47,230 --> 00:05:49,330
Just give it to me.

127
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,320
What are you doing?

128
00:05:50,330 --> 00:05:52,390
Don't worry. You'll thank me.

129
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:55,850
Hello,lalita?Raj koothrappali here.

130
