185
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:37,340
That's,um,rum and coke without the rum.

186
00:08:37,350 --> 00:08:38,580
Yes.

187
00:08:40,170 --> 00:08:42,370
- So...coke. - Yes.

188
00:08:43,750 --> 00:08:45,650
And would you make it diet?

189
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,650
There's a can in the fridge.

190
