204
00:09:37,860 --> 00:09:40,300
Is there another penny here?

205
00:09:41,150 --> 00:09:42,560
I had such plans.

206
00:09:42,570 --> 00:09:43,840
I had dreams.

207
00:09:43,850 --> 00:09:47,470
I was going to be the indira gandhi of particle astrophysics.

208
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:49,810
But with a penis,of course.

209
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:52,840
Amazing.

210
