I am talking to you.

233
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:51,740
Hello,penny,how are you?

234
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:53,890
I'm fine.

235
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:57,970
Okay,now I just need to make sure I have a lalita before I meet the grasshopper.

236
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:04,140
It's a sweet,green miracle.

237
