239
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:09,730
Overdo what?

240
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:11,250
Happiness?

241
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:13,360
Freedom?

242
00:11:13,370 --> 00:11:18,600
This warm glow inside of me that promises everything's going to be all hunky-dunky?

243
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:20,830
Yeah,that.

244
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:22,030
Why don't you bring her to my restaurant

245
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:24,180
