250
00:11:33,230 --> 00:11:35,500
Worked for my parents.

251
00:11:46,330 --> 00:11:49,890
I can't believe I'm sitting here next to little lalita gupta.

252
00:11:51,110 --> 00:11:52,490
Well,you are.

253
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,810
Little lalita.

254
00:11:55,290 --> 00:11:56,940
That's fd of kinun to say.

255
00:11:56,950 --> 00:11:59,650
Little lalita,little lalita,little lalita.

256
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:01,130
You should try it.

257
00:12:01,140 --> 00:12:02,750
Oh,it's okay.

258
00:12:05,470 --> 00:12:08,120
You have lost so much weight.

259
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:12,460
That must have been difficult for you because you were so,so fat.

260
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:15,460
